			"notes": "Modified Fabric port of ReNDI for Minecraft 1.21.5-1.21.11.\n\n## Features\n- Removes most post-hit invulnerability frames\n- Cancels very low-charge attacks\n- Suppresses knockback on low-charge hits\n- Keeps configurable exclusions for damage sources and entities\n\n## Requirements\n- Minecraft 1.21.5-1.21.11\n- Fabric Loader >= 0.17.3\n- Fabric API >= 0.114.1+1.21.5\n- Cloth Config >= 18.0.145\n- Mod Menu optional\n\n## License\nThis project is a modified build/port of ReNDI, distributed under LGPL-3.0-or-later.\nSource code for this modified version is available in this repository."
